From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TinyYana <yanasakuranight@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 23:07:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lophinya: exp - batch the shadow-run across a whole
 region-tick, not per-entity

Moves the RegionParallelRunner shadow-run call from inside Brain#tick (called
once per entity, batch size 1) to ServerLevel's entity-tick preamble (called
once per region per tick, batch = every ticking LivingEntity in the region).

The unbatched version measured ~16.3%/1.9% tick-time overhead for a no-op -
more expensive than the Brain Sensor Tick it would eventually replace (3.15%
in the same run), because submit+barrier+validate paid its fixed cost once
per entity instead of once per tick. This is the batched measurement of the
same pipeline, to test whether that fixed cost amortizes across a batch.

Still behaviour-identical: SensorShadowPhase's three methods remain no-ops.

exp/* isolated exploration branch per DEC-69. Not for merge into ver/26.2-nya.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
index e94ea890c83e65d987519379ebe3b5134bb14b42..ff4f3f1a7453aea347ad40864c08647e0a7a4322 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
@@ -930,6 +930,33 @@ public class ServerLevel extends Level implements WorldGenLevel, ServerEntityGet
                 if (dev.kaiijumc.kaiiju.KaiijuEntityLimits.enabled) regionizedWorldData.entityThrottler.tickLimiterStart(); // Kaiiju
             io.papermc.paper.entity.activation.ActivationRange.activateEntities(this); // Paper - EAR
             } finally { foliaProfiler.stopTimer(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.ACTIVATE_ENTITIES); } // Folia - profiler
+            // Lophinya start - region parallel phase framework (DEC-69): batched shadow-run pre-pass
+            // Default off (RegionParallelConfig.SENSOR_SHADOW_ENABLED). Collects every ticking entity
+            // in this region ONCE, then runs the no-op SensorShadowPhase through
+            // RegionParallelRunner.runPhase for the whole batch in a single call - contrast with the
+            // earlier per-entity version (batch size 1, called from inside Brain#tick, since removed)
+            // that measured unbatched overhead. This is the batched measurement of the same pipeline,
+            // see project-docs/evidence/20260805-region-parallel-phase-framework-design.md 7.
+            if (fun.bm.lophinya.parallel.RegionParallelConfig.SENSOR_SHADOW_ENABLED) {
+                foliaProfiler.startTimer(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.REGION_PARALLEL_SHADOW_RUN);
+                final java.util.List<Entity> shadowBatch = new java.util.ArrayList<>();
+                regionizedWorldData.forEachTickingEntity(e -> {
+                    if (!e.isRemoved() && e instanceof net.minecraft.world.entity.LivingEntity) {
+                        shadowBatch.add(e);
+                    }
+                });
+                final fun.bm.lophinya.parallel.RegionParallelRunner.Stats stats =
+                    fun.bm.lophinya.parallel.RegionParallelRunner.runPhase(
+                        this, shadowBatch, fun.bm.lophinya.parallel.SensorShadowPhase.INSTANCE);
+                foliaProfiler.stopTimer(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.REGION_PARALLEL_SHADOW_RUN);
+                foliaProfiler.addCounter(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.REGION_PARALLEL_SUBMITTED, stats.submitted);
+                foliaProfiler.addCounter(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.REGION_PARALLEL_QUEUE_FULL, stats.rejectedQueueFull);
+                foliaProfiler.addCounter(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.REGION_PARALLEL_TIMED_OUT, stats.timedOut);
+                foliaProfiler.addCounter(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.REGION_PARALLEL_DISCARDED_STALE, stats.discardedInvalid + stats.discardedNotOwned);
+                foliaProfiler.addCounter(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.REGION_PARALLEL_COMMITTED, stats.committed);
+            }
+            // Lophinya end - region parallel phase framework
+
             foliaProfiler.startTimer(ca.spottedleaf.leafprofiler.LProfilerRegistry.ENTITY_TICK); try { // Folia - profiler
             regionizedWorldData // Folia - regionised ticking
                 .forEachTickingEntity( // Folia - regionised ticking
